Error [E1272]: 2 packages lack a supported Nix compatibility output
 Why: `postgres@nixpkgs`, `ripgrep@nixpkgs` need a pinned compatibility output. Jetpack does not invoke an installed Nix executable for package realization.
 Fix: provide a pinned fixture or verified Hangar output, or replace the package with a native source/adapter; `jetpack add postgres@nixpkgs --adapt` drafts one.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1272
